<title>USA: P.H. Glatfelter Sept 30 Q2 shr declines.</title>
<headline>P.H. Glatfelter Sept 30 Q2 shr declines.</headline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.31		    $0.39</p>
<p> Net		 13,237		   17,103</p>
<p> Sales	     139,748		  160,771</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  42,789		   44,352</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $1.01		    $1.10</p>
<p> Net		 43,483		   48,642</p>
<p> Sales	     424,770		  482,687</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  42,978		   44,392</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Full company name is P.H. Glatfelter Co</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said its third quarter 1996 net income declined due to lower selling prices for most of its printing and writing papers, which were somewhat offset by lower material costs for market pulp and wastepaper.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
